{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00401",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.3,
      "end_seconds": 4.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Hello again. Come on in. Did you come far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.69,
      "end_seconds": 9.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Yeah, not too far, about half an hour by bus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.33,
      "end_seconds": 12.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Tell me what's been troubling you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.17,
      "end_seconds": 23.98,
      "duration_seconds": 9.81,
      "text": "Yeah, it's a dry cough that won't go away. I don't know what's causing it. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.38,
      "end_seconds": 27.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.37,
      "end_seconds": 31.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "It's been going on for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.75,
      "end_seconds": 39.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.03,
      "end_seconds": 49.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.18,
      "text": "I get some relief from sipping water. A three out of ten, I suppose. It's worse with lying down and after meals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.75,
      "end_seconds": 53.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.74,
      "end_seconds": 57.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Hmm, um, I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.86,
      "end_seconds": 61.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Have you had any shortness of breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.44,
      "end_seconds": 64.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "No, no shortness of breath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.27,
      "end_seconds": 68.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Have you had any wheezing or night sweats?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.96,
      "end_seconds": 73.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Oh, no wheezing or night sweats, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.45,
      "end_seconds": 77.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.58,
      "end_seconds": 78.36,
      "duration_seconds": 0.78,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.6,
      "end_seconds": 96.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.51,
      "end_seconds": 99.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Nothing, um, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.18,
      "end_seconds": 103.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.61,
      "end_seconds": 105.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.46,
      "end_seconds": 117.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.21,
      "end_seconds": 121.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "I'm allergic to sulfa drugs, I get itching all over."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.91,
      "end_seconds": 126.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.88,
      "end_seconds": 132.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.74,
      "end_seconds": 134.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.94,
      "end_seconds": 137.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.78,
      "end_seconds": 141.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.96,
      "end_seconds": 145.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.2,
      "end_seconds": 149.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.41,
      "end_seconds": 161.83,
      "duration_seconds": 11.42,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.63,
      "end_seconds": 173.8,
      "duration_seconds": 11.17,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.23,
      "end_seconds": 178.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.74,
      "end_seconds": 182.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.18,
      "end_seconds": 187.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.91,
      "end_seconds": 203.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Chest is clear and the throat looks a little red at the back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.87,
      "end_seconds": 211.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.73,
      "end_seconds": 215.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.78,
      "end_seconds": 218.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.11,
      "end_seconds": 244.04,
      "duration_seconds": 11.93,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like a cough driven by acid reflux. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.0,
      "end_seconds": 247.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Oh, is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.1,
      "end_seconds": 264.38,
      "duration_seconds": 16.28,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a cough driven by acid reflux, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a dry cough that won't go away for nearly five years, and no shortness of breath or wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.34,
      "end_seconds": 267.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.97,
      "end_seconds": 282.51,
      "duration_seconds": 14.54,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.65,
      "end_seconds": 285.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.7,
      "end_seconds": 298.26,
      "duration_seconds": 11.56,
      "text": "I'm going to order a chest X-ray, for chronic cough. I'd like you to take pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast, for four weeks. You take it by mouth. It's for reflux."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.81,
      "end_seconds": 301.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Okay, and I take that after food?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.7,
      "end_seconds": 313.14,
      "duration_seconds": 10.44,
      "text": "Don't eat for two or three hours before lying down, and raise the head of the bed a little. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.62,
      "end_seconds": 320.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.01,
      "text": "Right. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.29,
      "end_seconds": 325.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Okay, um, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.29,
      "end_seconds": 328.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Let's review you in a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.69,
      "end_seconds": 332.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.34,
      "end_seconds": 339.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.21,
      "end_seconds": 348.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.23,
      "text": "So, I take the pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast and come back in a month. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.96,
      "end_seconds": 353.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.54,
      "end_seconds": 357.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "That's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}